{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/extras/Goth_Scrolling.png?t=1745019483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have your very own goth girl that will begrudgingly keep you company 24/7. This desktop companion silently judges everything you do.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She will always be there but not because she wants to be</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Light her cigarette and maybe she'll start thinking about you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Disrupt her gaze into the abyss to get some attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She can't be fixed and you'll like it that way</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3621840?t=1745019483","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/1e381e2e8f90b9dd91595d5b93df530567064e2b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745019483","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/dc86b2c33a6bb4599990cffaeb766827616d290b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745019483","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/dc86b2c33a6bb4599990cffaeb766827616d290b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745019483","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Some of her dialogues can be very mean."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3621840/extras/Goth_Scrolling.png?t=1745019483\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have your very own goth girl that will begrudgingly keep you company 24/7. This desktop companion silently judges everything you do.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">She will always be there but not because she wants 